15,-0.01203397,0.03211829,-0.07824428,0.01389609,-0.07720643,0.01197528,0.04391808,0.21491824,-0.05896899,-0.00052787,0.04068363,-0.00783646,-0.01869785,0.02505835,-0.01961653,-0.01234439,0.02023786,0.07389226,0.02266608,0.02108375,0.05795364,-0.06653848,-0.0576485,-0.02340167,-0.01673132,0.02969407,0.01667525,-0.02215451,-0.04893629,0.12355138,0.02101438,-0.0412945,-0.04721363,-0.02742804,-0.01539859,0.01187461,-0.01892164,-0.01560901,-0.00457595,0.02407242,-0.04216175,-0.0122865,-0.01240614,-0.03463145,-0.01783549,0.02662286,0.01314031,-0.03097881,0.0949405,-0.06467259],"last_embed":{"hash":"d6yh3q","tokens":479}}},"last_read":{"hash":"d6yh3q","at":1778067901097},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523000,"size":5101,"at":1778067901097,"hash":"d6yh3q"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information":[20,50],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#{1}":[21,25],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,36],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#📝 Benim Notlarım#{1}":[27,28],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#📝 Benim Notlarım#{2}":[29,36],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[37,39],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[40,42],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[41,42],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[43,45],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[44,45],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[46,48],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[47,48],"#Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[49,50]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/MQ79MFR2","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SUBMMTDE?page=1&annotation=2ZVYDDM3","line":41},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SUBMMTDE?page=1&annotation=FGC2SDGU","line":41},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SUBMMTDE?page=1&annotation=KQDSLFZR","line":44},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SUBMMTDE?page=2&annotation=LQIWCHKC","line":47}],"metadata":{"Title":"Consistency and Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Providing Nutritional Information","Authors":"Yen Nhi Hoang, Ya-Ling Chen, Dang Khanh Ngan Ho, Wan-Chun Chiu, Khang-Jin Cheah, Noor Rohmah Mayasari, Jung-Su Chang","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1001/jamanetworkopen.2023.50367","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"The aim of the study was to compare the reliability of ChatGPT-3.5 (chatbot 1) and ChatGPT-4 (chatbot 2) in providing information on the calorie and macronutrient content (carbohydrates, fats, and proteins) for 8 menus designed for adults (222 food items)A search was performed between September and October 2023 using the following prompt: “As a dietitian, please draw a table to calculate line by line the energy (kcal)/carbohydrates (g)/lipids (g)/proteins (g) of the following food items (raw, not cooked).” The consistency of AI responses was determined on the basis of the coefficient variation (CV) for each food item across 5 repeated measurements. To assess the accuracy of responses, we cross-referenced the AI answers with nutritionists’ recommendations based on the food composition database of the Taiwanese Food and Drug Administration.","Findings":"No significant differences were observed between nutritionist and AI estimations of energy, carbohydrate, and fat contents of 8 menus designed for adults, but there was a significant difference in protein estimation. Both chatbots provided accurate energy contents for approximately 35% to 48% of the 222 food items within ±10%, with a CV of less than 10% (Table). Chatbot 2 performed better than chatbot 1, but it overestimated protein.","Conclusions":"Although AI chatbots are designed to be probabilistic, the results of this cross-sectional study suggest that AI can be a useful and convenient tool for people who want to know the energy and macronutrient information of their foods. Although AI chatbots cannot replace nutritionists, they may provide real-time analysis of foods, and the capacity to harness AI technology in a supportive role may fundamentally transform the way nutritionists communicate with patients.5","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"letter  dyt karşılaştırması var  dyt= ai çıkmış  prompt var  dyt ile ai yer değiştiremez beyanı var"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"d6yh3q","at":1774939756478},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/hoangConsistencyAccuracyArtificial2023a.md"},
